# Facts about Bram Hollis.

@fact bram.prefect
tier: surface
text: A prefect of your own year, with a red sash, a ledger of demerits and a fondness for your name.

@fact bram.father
tier: secret
hint: Someone's opinion weighs on him more than any rule.
unlock: seen(bram_crying) > 0 or seen(bram_father_visit) > 0
text: His father was head boy, and has told Bram all his life that he will never amount to anything.

@fact bram.hall_tax
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the east staircase.
unlock: seen(bram_hall_tax) > 0
text: He once invented a "hall tax" for the east staircase.

@fact bram.cheating
tier: secret
hint: Prefects sit exams too.
unlock: seen(bram_cheating) > 0
text: You saw him cheat in an exam. He knows you saw.

@fact bram.ally
tier: personal
hint: Under the sash, there may be someone else.
unlock: seen(bram_turns) > 0
text: Under the sash, he will step between you and trouble. Then he tells you not to make it weird.

@fact bram.portrait
tier: personal
hint: Walk the corridor of head boys with him.
unlock: seen(bram_portrait) > 0
text: His father's portrait hangs in the corridor of head boys. Every visit, his father stops in front of it, and then looks at Bram.

@fact bram.rematch
tier: personal
hint: Beat him at something he cares about.
unlock: seen(bram_rematch) > 0
text: When he loses, he practises alone on the duelling green every evening for a month, and then asks for a rematch.
